  "equipment_type": "Heat pump (packaged wall-mount)",
  "applies_to": "Eubank EAH1020H-1060H / EAH2024H-2042H wall-mount heat pumps (I&O manual rev. 6); the HAH1024-1060 A/C with gas heat manual (rev. 5) prints the same table.",
  "summary": "Eubank EAH wall-mount heat pumps and HAH gas-heat air conditioners (AirX brand, sister to Marvair) use an electronic control board with two RJ11 Modbus RTU ports. Over Modbus the board accepts thermostat and reversing-valve calls, reports switch, relay and sensor states and an alarm word, and exposes fan, economizer and calibration settings.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": 1,
    "baud": 19200,
    "parity": "None",
    "data_bits": 8,
    "stop_bits": 1,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "0-based",
    "note": "The map prints a zero-based packet ID next to a reference ID (coils 1-30, registers 40001-40039). The zero-based ID is the wire address."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": null,
  "source": {
    "title": "EAH1020H-1048H-2024H-2042H Wall Mount HP Installation & Operation Manual",
    "doc_number": "Rev. 6",
    "revision_date": "2026-05",
    "url": "https://eubankwallmount.com/doc/59/EAH1020H-1048H-2024H-2042H%20Wall%20Mount%20HP%20Manual%20Rev%206",
    "pages": "Appendix A, pp. 59-61"
  },
  "notes": [
    "The manual prints two columns: a zero-based 'packet register ID' (used as the address here) and a one-based reference ID. Coils and registers each start at zero-based ID 0.",
    "Bit points: the board reads all of them with function 02 and writes the RW ones with function 05 (single coil only, no function 15). Coils and discrete inputs share one address space. RW bits are listed as coils, read-only bits as discrete inputs.",
    "Registers: the board reads them with function 04 and writes RW ones with function 06 (single register only, no function 16). RW registers are listed as holding registers so they can be written; the manual only documents reading them with function 04 at the same address. Whether function 01/03 reads work is not stated.",
    "Writes to read-only points return an error.",
    "Calibration registers hold 0-18 with 9 = no correction; the applied correction is the value minus 9.",
    "Heat and cool set points (registers 0-1) are writable but marked 'not currently used, for future use'.",
    "Anti-short-cycle timers count in 0.5 s steps (scale 0.5).",
    "The Eubank HAH1024-1060 A/C with gas heat I&O manual (rev. 5, 10/2025, Appendix A, PDF pp. 73-75) prints the same table: https://eubankwallmount.com/doc/65/HAH1024-1060%20AC%20wGas%20Heat%20Manual%20Rev%205",
    "In this table IFM Y1/Y2 set speeds are 0-1023 and alarm bit 0 is 'flat circuit fault'; registers stop at 38."
  ],
